This repository holds two kinds of work, under two licences.

## Content and artwork — CC BY-SA 4.0

Everything in `website/`, `graphics/` and `research/` is licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence.

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Take it, translate it, put your own village's name on it. Credit Escudo, and
share what you improve under the same terms.

Third-party material inside those directories keeps its own licence:

  - The crest is drawn with Material Design Icons (Apache-2.0).
  - Fonts are Bricolage Grotesque and Public Sans (SIL Open Font Licence).
  - The Hugo theme in `website/themes/book/` is MIT, per its own LICENSE.
  - Externally sourced photographs are credited, with their individual CC
    licences and required attribution, in `graphics/photos-external/CREDITS.md`.

## Software — MIT

Everything in `tech-implementation/` is licensed under the MIT licence, the
full text of which is at `tech-implementation/bot/LICENSE`.

